{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"liyue_geography","name_zh":"璃月核心地理","name_en":"Core Liyue Geography","aliases":["璃月核心地理","Core Liyue Geography"],"category":"geography","scope":"regional","regions":["Liyue"],"summary":"璃月位于提瓦特东部，地貌由高山、石林、平原、河滩、海港与矿区共同构成。主要区域包括碧水原、琼玑野、珉林、云来海、璃沙郊、层岩巨渊与沉玉谷；其地理格局既受河流冲积等自然过程影响，也保留了魔神战争、聚落迁徙和采矿活动留下的遗迹。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_01","text":"璃月是提瓦特七国之一，位于提瓦特东部；高山、石林、开阔平原和河流共同构成其主要地貌，景观具有四季变化。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期地理格局","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_02","text":"璃月的主要区域包括碧水原、璃沙郊、珉林、琼玑野、云来海、层岩巨渊与沉玉谷。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前区域划分","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_03","text":"碧水河穿过碧水原；碧水原下辖荻花洲、轻策庄、地中之盐、石门、望舒客栈和无妄坡。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_03","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_04","text":"荻花洲是受碧水河塑造的冲积平原，水域与蒲苇构成其代表性景观。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期地貌","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_03","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","local_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_05","text":"望舒客栈在荻花洲中的具体方位存在资料冲突：观景资料和中文核验页称其位于荻花洲南端，钟离则称其地处荻花洲中部。","status":"disputed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","local_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_06","text":"望舒客栈建于高处，视野开阔，坐落在通往璃月的要道之一，除接待旅客外还具有监视四周和镇守道路的战略作用。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前用途","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_03","local_sup_liyue_geography_02"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_07","text":"琼玑野下辖归离原、渌华池、明蕴镇和瑶光滩；瑶光滩位于明蕴镇以南、归离原以东。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_08","text":"归离原曾是归离集古代文明的中心区域，魔神战争期间遭到毁坏；当地居民后来被带往天衡山以南，璃月港由此建立。归离原如今主要保留为聚落遗址。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"魔神战争时期至今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_06","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_09","text":"明蕴镇原为矿业聚落；随着多处矿藏枯竭、剩余矿产不足以维持聚落，居民陆续迁往璃月港和层岩巨渊，镇区因而大体废弃。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"近年","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_10","text":"珉林下辖翠玦坡、华光林、绝云间、奥藏山、琥牢山、南天门、庆云顶和天遒谷，是璃月高山、石峰与仙家洞府集中分布的区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_05","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_11","text":"绝云间位于归离原以西。璃月人相信那里是仙人洞府所在，通常只在外围供奉而不敢深入；「公子」则声称自己通过情报确定仙人确实存在。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当前认知","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_liyue_geography_04","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_05"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_12","text":"华光林的石峰从云间高耸而出，其周围分布着北面的奥藏山、东面的庆云顶和西南面的琥牢山。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地貌","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_05","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_13","text":"南天门谷地中的伏龙树被用于封印若陀龙王；其根系深入地下，并与地脉相连。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"封印形成后至今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_05","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_14","text":"云来海下辖孤云阁、璃月港和天衡山；璃月港是千帆汇集、商贸繁盛的港城。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理与城市格局","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_06","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_15","text":"孤云阁是由七座大岛及若干小型岛屿组成的群岛。相传岩王帝君曾在此击败 Osial，岛上的突兀峭岩是当时投下的石枪遗迹；此成因在资料中以传说形式出现。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"魔神战争时期至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_06","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_16","text":"璃沙郊下辖遁玉陵、灵矩关和青墟浦，区域内广泛分布古代遗迹；它也是璃月港与层岩巨渊矿区之间的连接地带。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_07","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_17","text":"层岩巨渊由地上区域和地下矿区构成；地上多高耸悬崖，地下则分布幽深峡谷、矿坑、矿道、水泽和古代遗迹，整体结构复杂且光线昏暗。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地貌","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_18","text":"层岩巨渊深处发生变动后，连接璃月港与矿区的工作一度停止；矿井入口原已由璃月七星封闭，近期地震又使其更加危险。其后封闭入口的法阵被解除，但现有证据未说明矿区已全面复工。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"近期至当前","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_07"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_geography_fact_19","text":"沉玉谷包括上谷、南陵与来钦山等区域。沿碧水河逆流而上可抵达 Yilong Wharf；该港口建在巨大瀑布旁，位于璃月北部边缘，是商人与船员往来的繁盛港埠。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理与聚落格局","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","bwiki_liyue_geography"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"魔神战争时期","order_hint":10,"events":["归离集所在区域在战争中毁坏，原有聚落瓦解。","当地居民被带往天衡山以南，璃月港随后建立。"],"current_status":"归离原保留为遗址，璃月港则发展为繁荣港城。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_06","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01"]},{"period":"近年","order_hint":20,"events":["明蕴镇多处矿藏逐渐枯竭，居民向璃月港和层岩巨渊迁移。"],"current_status":"明蕴镇已大体成为废弃矿业聚落。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","bwiki_liyue_geography"]},{"period":"近期地质变动后","order_hint":30,"events":["层岩巨渊深处发生变动，相关工作停止。","矿井入口在已被璃月七星封闭的情况下又受到近期地震影响，危险程度上升。"],"current_status":"这一阶段的层岩巨渊处于停工和封闭状态。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","fandom_sup_liyue_geography_07"]},{"period":"其后","order_hint":40,"events":["封闭层岩巨渊入口的法阵被解除。","曾导致矿区关闭的异常晶石被送回地下更深处。"],"current_status":"入口封印与异常晶石的状态已经改变，但证据没有说明矿区是否已全面恢复开采。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"璃月居民及经常往来的商旅通常能够辨认主要区域、港口、村镇和交通路线；古战场成因、仙家洞府、客栈的战略使命以及层岩巨渊深部情况则并非普遍知识。","likely_known_by":["璃月各地居民","往来璃月的商人、船员与旅客","璃月七星及总务司相关人员","层岩巨渊的矿工和调查人员","活动于绝云间及珉林山区的仙人"],"unlikely_known_by":["从未到访璃月且缺少地图或情报的普通外地人","不了解古战场与地下矿区记录的普通民众"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["璃月人相信绝云间是仙人洞府，通常只敢在外围供奉。","孤云阁的石峰被广泛传为岩王帝君镇压 Osial 时所投石枪的遗迹。","望舒客栈的摊贩之间流传其高塔藏有秘密的说法，但无人能够验证。"]},"activation_keys":["璃月核心地理","Core Liyue Geography"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["璃月的游戏解锁条件及相关任务前置条件。","传送锚点、谜题、宝箱、成就、秘境、首领、采集物、交互物和攻略信息。","观景点数量、收集条件、档案显示条件及玩家操作。","原声音乐列表、任务列表、角色和 NPC 数量。","随游戏版本发布或扩展地图的版本记录，以及场景物件和敌人营地调整。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["琼玑野「八百里」是否代表实际地理尺度，证据明确表示无法确定。","无名遗迹是遭受惩罚而毁灭的古代文明、紫黑晶体与倒吊城市存在因果关系等说法，仅为观景记录者的推测。","层岩巨渊蓝色晶柱必定来自天空的说法是记录者个人判断。","中文核验页关于第一文明建筑、孤云阁原有岛屿及部分古国遗址的编辑性推断，没有 Fandom 或直接游戏文本支持。","中文核验页关于岩中幽谷经历葬火之战、天钉隆起及至交反目等复合历史叙述，没有主要来源或直接游戏文本支持。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_liyue_geography","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Liyue","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Liyue","language":"en","revision_id":"1859917","source_text_sha256":"cdc629568f144894f6ea09a5b2365a8c6c6c4d3706d26892ff2cb3e3d346da4c"},{"source_id":"bwiki_liyue_geography","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"璃月·地理","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E7%92%83%E6%9C%88%C2%B7%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%86","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"644044","source_text_sha256":"14da984949a4c2368aa463566182f9bcb1fa19c58cd3e76430c1a399a64eaf10"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Liyue","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Liyue","language":"en","revision_id":"1859917","source_text_sha256":"b2c8fb1eff1a13d2e4116a794c61e49bc35cd7235a2df86066e5b96a124d74f7"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Liyue","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Liyue","language":"en","revision_id":"2128781","source_text_sha256":"e2b0c9934185b3ffaefab3cd156ecc8737ce149f0caac9e089ad59f61d6e253b"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Bishui Plain","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Bishui_Plain","language":"en","revision_id":"2074287","source_text_sha256":"3489b3f54f99b70855ea2efa7fc5bd039541cf2cf5bcb8c778016cee182e2b66"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Qiongji Estuary","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Qiongji_Estuary","language":"en","revision_id":"2098908","source_text_sha256":"97d992cea7acd242f8c0eb966953f2871afb82182f625c87cf0b366147735712"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Minlin","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Minlin","language":"en","revision_id":"2074285","source_text_sha256":"3723f50183e4d5886a2d7bb6907d6d42f0a629dc40d55ffbac2dcf80c2bd8ab2"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Sea of Clouds","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Sea_of_Clouds","language":"en","revision_id":"1715225","source_text_sha256":"b623fcbe23999c09c2438238444e803692e852ff36c5492af9df56eef1f069ce"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_geography_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Lisha","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lisha","language":"en","revision_id":"1715213","source_text_sha256":"dd408977aff4736a2636f605e16a2c57acee67b02e9446d92f669fe66061c53b"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_geography_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"本地游戏对话 7165816","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Npc/Npc_7165816.json#unit=7165816","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"e719c30644035b8524b3e8a3e6a313c11c9816fa04fbc9241bfc4e3a7493d689"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_geography_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"请仙","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_1000.json#unit=100014","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"7b9b7b71a1bc4a75375c2539c48f284df1ebfde3ee3fcda9d9d390bd397fd092"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"526cf2b564f6b056a2cea2d859c7e60d803c72d777457d30af9aee0e56d2dac2","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":["望舒客栈的位置描述存在冲突：英文 Fandom 观景资料与 BWiki 称其位于荻花洲南端，中文直接游戏对话则称其位于荻花洲中部。","BWiki 的区域标题写作「岷林」，而 Fandom 的官方简体中文名称栏写作「珉林」；本卡采用后者。"],"uncertain_claims":["孤云阁石峰的具体形成过程以传说形式记载；在当地过夜者感受到的异象究竟源于 Osial 还是其他现象仍属未知。","层岩巨渊入口法阵解除后，矿区是否已全面恢复开采没有明确证据。","绝云间为仙人洞府的认知在璃月民间以信仰和传说形式存在，「公子」则将其表述为情报确认。"],"missing_evidence":[],"needs_human_review":true}}